 edits=[write('main','Current edible-bean circle is delivered: A received '+lot+', B received S33, C received S11. The vine label was last summer\'s lot.|本次食用豆种循环已签收：A收'+lot+'、B收S33、C收S11；藤类标签是去年那批。'),write('old1','C sends S33 to B; A sends S11 to C.|C把S33给B，A把S11给C。'),write('old2','That repost links last summer\'s H07, not these current bean lots.|那张转发指去年H07，不是本次豆种。'),write('old3','No extra failed-leg postage: current outgoing20 each was settled once from existing escrow.|失败旧路段不重复收费，本次各寄出20已从原托管结一次。')]
